---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Us | yourtool.in" description="Learn more about yourtool.in and our mission to help builders manage their links.">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-20">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-black dark:text-white mb-8 text-center">About Us</h1>
        
        <div class="prose prose-zinc dark:prose-invert max-w-none space-y-6 text-gray-600 dark:text-zinc-400">
            <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed">
                Welcome to <span class="font-bold text-black dark:text-white">yourtool.in</span>, your ultimate toolkit for modern builders. We believe that managing your daily links shouldn't be a chore, and discovering high-quality tools should be effortless.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-black dark:text-white mt-12 mb-4">Our Mission</h2>
            <p>
                Our mission is to provide a fast, minimal, and premium workspace where you can save, organize, and access your favorite resources. Whether you're a developer, designer, or entrepreneur, yourtool.in is designed to streamline your workflow and help you stay focused on what matters most—building.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-black dark:text-white mt-12 mb-4">Hidden Gems</h2>
            <p>
                Beyond a personal workspace, yourtool.in features a community-driven directory of "Hidden Gems." These are curated tools, libraries, and resources that provide exceptional value but might not be widely known yet. We're building a space where the community can share and upvote the best of the web.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-black dark:text-white mt-12 mb-4">Built for You</h2>
            <p>
                yourtool.in was built with a focus on speed, privacy, and user experience. We use modern technologies to ensure a seamless experience across all your devices.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</Layout>
